{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19180","headline":"和乐天题真娘墓 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天题真娘墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薝卜林中黄土堆，罗襦绣黛已成灰。\n芳魂虽死人不怕，蔓草逢春花自开。\n幡盖向风疑舞袖，镜灯临晓似妆台。\n吴王娇女坟相近，一片行云应往来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}